id: pm-graph-yuzr
title: "Certify pm CLI 2026.9.21 and move onto the canonical pm-ops merge-driver, lint and duplication gates"
description: "Adopt pm CLI 2026.9.21, pin @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.21 / pm-changelog / pm-ops exactly, absorb open Dependabot PRs, replace the vendored merge-driver prepare hook with the thin pm-ops/merge-driver launcher, add the canonical lint (pm-ops/eslint) and duplication (pm-ops/jscpd) gates with zero findings, fix the ~81 'any' type sites against real neo4j-driver types, and wire CI to require merge drivers. Companion epic pm-cli-website-5s6z."
